      "The routing endpoint has a p95 latency target of 800 ms. It runs on Claude Opus 5.5 at medium effort with 99% accuracy and a p95 of 2.1 seconds. About 85% of requests are easy and the rest involve conflicting account data. Product wants a faster default without losing routing quality. What data would justify moving to a lighter configuration?",
