      "For each renewal request, the app sends the entire 14-month policy decision log (about 95,000 tokens) plus the patron's record. In 7% of answers the model cites a 2025 policy that was superseded in March. Input cost per request is the largest line in the bill, and latency is above target. What should each request contain?",
